  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Vulcanisaeta sp. 768-28 is an obligately anaerobic acidophile with a pH range of growth from 3.5 to 6.5 and a temperature range from 60 to 98°C."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "This strain grew optimally at 80–85\\\"C and pH 5.0–5.5."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "The media were reduced by boiling and subsequent addition of 700 mg l 1 Na2S.9H2O."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": "Headspace of the enrichment vials was filled with 100% oxygen-free CO2."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": "The pH of the media was adjusted by the addition of 6 N HCl and was controlled after autoclaving (120 or 110\\\"C when elemental sulfur was added)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
